Description: Stabilize 1.95 test suite under LLVM 22 and root buildds
 Launchpad buildds execute parts of the test suite as root, which breaks a
 couple of permission and RLIMIT_NPROC tests. LLVM 22 related packaging
 directives also shifted some UI reference line numbers. Keep the tests
 deterministic for the package build.
Author: Codex <codex@example.org>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-07-10

